        "description": "Logs in with a username or an email and a password, and sets the session cookie. A session that the request already has is replaced. Every failure answers 401 `invalid_credentials`. After 5 failures for one login, or 20 for one client IP, attempts answer 429 `rate_limited` with `Retry-After` in seconds, the delay doubling from 1 second up to 15 minutes.",
